| change what the installer writes | below |

## Installer (installer.rs)

Non-destructive merge into `~/.claude/settings.json`: our entries are recognised by the `warroom-hook`
marker in `command`; foreign hooks are untouched; a `.warroom-bak` copy is written before each change;
invalid JSON is refused; the bridge is copied (tmp + rename, to avoid ETXTBSY) to
`~/.local/share/agent-war-room/bin/` only if it is a real ELF. `PermissionRequest` gets a 600 s timeout
(the bridge gives up at 590 s), every other hook 5 s.
